        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se rumorea que quien mire dentro de su cuerpo cubierto de vendas será absorbido entre ellas para no regresar jamás. Solo pensarlo me infunde tal pavor que no he podido indagar más.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふしぎな　ての　うごきを　みつめたあいての　たましいを　からだからぬきとるといわれ　こわがられている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "이상한 손의 움직임을 본 상대의 영혼을 몸에서 끄집어낸다고 하여 공포의 대상으로 여겨지고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "據說要是盯著牠神秘的手部動作看，靈魂就會被牠從身體裡抽走，因此被人們深深恐懼。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il inspire la crainte, car on dit qu’il peut extraire l’âme des personnes qui ont observé les étranges mouvements de ses mains.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wird gefürchtet, da es jenen, die auf die mysteriösen Bewegungen seiner Hände starren, die Seele aus dem Leib ziehen soll.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se lo teme porque, según cuentan, extrae el alma del cuerpo de quienes ven los extraños movimientos de sus manos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È temuto perché si dice sia in grado di strappare via l’anima dal corpo di chi osserva i misteriosi movimenti delle sue mani.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dusclops is feared because it’s said to pull the soul out of anyone who gazes upon the strange movements of its hands.",
